Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 09:12:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: keep titles short enough for the list view

The list view truncates anything longer than 100 characters, so stop accepting more.
---
 notes/limits.go | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/notes/limits.go b/notes/limits.go
index 97b1b3b..5f528d8 100644
--- a/notes/limits.go
+++ b/notes/limits.go
@@ -3,7 +3,7 @@ package notes
 const (
 	DefaultPageSize = 20
 	MaxPageSize     = 100
-	MaxTitleLength  = 120
+	MaxTitleLength  = 100
 	MaxBodyLength   = 10_000
 	MaxTags         = 10
 	MaxTagLength    = 32
